# ── Rust ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# ── Android / Gradle / Kotlin ────────────────────────────
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
apps/fetchit-android/local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
# release-signing config (the .template version is committed)
apps/fetchit-android/app/keystore.properties

# ── Local-only working drafts ────────────────────────────
# Anchored — must NOT match `apps/*/src/private/` if that dir is
# ever introduced as source code (mirrors the etch/it gitignore fix).
/private/
# Compiled FFI libraries — rebuilt by `cargo ndk build` from fetchit-ffi
apps/fetchit-android/app/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so

# ── Generated bindings (rebuild from source) ─────────────
generated/
# ...except the derived crate-list doc artifact, which IS checked in
# (it is the single source docs reference; regenerated by scripts/gen-crate-list.sh).
!docs/generated/
!docs/generated/crate-list.txt

